`** now shows the existing \u2299 **jump glyph** when:\n  - the playing track is in a *different folder* (existing behavior), **or**\n  - **on Linux only**, the playing track is in the **current folder** but its row is **not visible in the viewport**.\n- When the glyph is tapped, `jumpToNowPlaying()` **does not change folders** if already in the playing parent folder, and it forces a rebuild after scrolling so the glyph hides correctly.\n\n### Screenshots (before/after)\n**Before:** no jump glyph when playing track is offscreen but parent folder matches  \n`/workspace/.tmp/agent_shots/void_jump_glyph_before.png`\n\n**After:** jump glyph appears and activation scrolls the playing row into view  \n`/workspace/.tmp/agent_shots/void_jump_glyph_after.png`  \n\n### Files modified\n- `lib/widgets/void_browser.dart`\n- `lib/screens/void_screen.dart`\n- `test/screens/void_screen_test.dart` (added coverage for the offscreen-in-current-folder Linux case)","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c913a4a54974ada016a7903eaf4988194b46016ae44c476e7\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"azure-openai-responses","provider":"azure-openai-responses","model":"gpt-5.4-nano","usage":{"input":199,"output":1306,"cacheRead":69120,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":989,"totalTokens":70625,"cost":{"input":3.9800000000000005e-05,"output":0.0016325,"cacheRead":0.0013824,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0030547}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1786315746188,"responseId":"resp_0c913a4a54974ada016a7903e46c1081949acc8c375281bb6a","rawStopReason":"completed"}}},{"sequence":12347,"timestamp":"2026-08-09T22:49:35.081817Z","elapsed_seconds":695.184,"source":"pi","event":{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0c913a4a54974ada016a7903e511d88194a251be09d47b4f85\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqeQPqBvl8TxxAj9W1VnrLUgJO2zExpFd0i54TV_UOcynUP8QgqAjEJa_ao1fjlcH13qEZZudrz-CIg3Dd0uRuTdocP3Uc2X3cnNEqEqU